{"sha": "fd1fe8251f6d4b400688e94fc76bbc42e98bef0089228b04bf7b3af265fe8d21", "body": ["\\textbf{5.} 摆长过短，走快，每天快 $(2.000 -", "1.988)/1.988 \\times 86400 \\approx \\qty{5.2e2}{s} \\approx 8.7$", "分钟。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 月球：$\\times\\sqrt{9.81/1.62} = 2.46$ --- 不可用。", "天文台：$\\Delta T_0/T_0 = \\tfrac12 \\times 0.01/9.81 =", "\\num{5.1e-4}$：每天慢 $\\approx \\qty{44}{s}$。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $\\Delta L = L\\lambda\\,\\Delta\\theta = 0.994 \\times", "\\num{1.9e-5} \\times 5.0 \\approx \\qty{9.4e-5}{m} \\approx", "\\qty{0.1}{mm}$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $T' = 2\\pi\\sqrt{L(1 + \\lambda\\Delta\\theta)/g} =", "T_0\\sqrt{1 + \\lambda\\Delta\\theta} \\approx T_0\\,(1 + \\tfrac12", "\\lambda\\Delta\\theta)$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\Delta T_0/T_0 = \\tfrac12 \\times \\num{1.9e-5} \\times", "5.0 = \\num{4.8e-5}$：$86400 \\times \\num{4.8e-5} \\approx", "\\qty{4.1}{s}$ 每天，偏慢（杆变长，周期变长）。", "", "\\textbf{10.} $\\Delta\\theta = \\qty{-10}{K}$：$\\Delta T_0/T_0 =", "\\num{-9.5e-5}$，每天快 $\\approx \\qty{8.2}{s}$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 钢与黄铜膨胀不同，两者交替反向悬挂；", "黄铜杆使摆锤下降，钢杆则使其上升，", "经设计使两者的变化相互抵消，等效摆长 ---", "以及走时 --- 不随季节而变。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $280/2.000 = 140$ 个周期。", "", "\\textbf{13.} $\\theta_m = 2.00^\\circ = \\qty{0.0349}{rad}$：$E_m =", "\\tfrac12 \\times 1.2 \\times 9.81 \\times 0.994 \\times 0.0349^2 \\approx", "\\qty{7.1e-3}{J}$。", "", "\\textbf{14.} 每个周期内振幅缩小为原来的 $2^{-1/140} \\approx", "0.9951$，能量则乘以 $0.9951^2 \\approx 0.990$，即每周期约损失 $1.0\\%$", "的 $E_m$。", "", "\\textbf{15.} 每次推动补充的能量 $\\approx 0.010 \\times \\num{7.1e-3} =", "\\qty{7.1e-5}{J}$；功率 $\\num{7.1e-5}/2.0 \\approx \\qty{3.5e-5}{W}$", "--- 数十微瓦。", "", "\\textbf{16.} 一周共 $604800/2.0 = \\num{3.02e5}$ 个周期，", "需能量 $\\num{3.02e5} \\times \\num{7.1e-5} \\approx \\qty{21}{J}$；重物", "提供 $Mgh = 2.5 \\times 9.81 \\times 1.0 = \\qty{24.5}{J}$：足够，", "效率约为 $21/24.5 \\approx 88\\%$。", "", "\\textbf{17.} $T = 1/\\num{32768} = \\qty{30.5}{\\micro s}$。$\\num{32768}", "= 2^{15}$：十五级二分频将晶体的信号", "变为精确的 \\qty{1}{Hz} 滴答。", "", "\\textbf{18.} 石英：$0.3/\\num{2.6e6} \\approx \\num{1.2e-7}$。", "摆钟：$0.5/86400 \\approx \\num{5.8e-6}$，即 $\\approx", "\\qty{15}{s}$ 每月。石英的精度约高 $\\approx 50$ 倍。", "", "\\textbf{19.} $1/\\num{3.2e15} \\approx \\num{3e-16}$：比石英低九个", "数量级。GPS 将信号时间精确到纳秒 ---", "光每纳秒传播 \\qty{30}{cm} ---，故只有原子钟才够用。", "", "\\textbf{20.} 修复后，挂钟每月误差保持在 $\\pm\\qty{15}{s}$ 以内，", "相比之下石英仅为每月 $\\pm\\qty{0.3}{s}$：挂钟留作报时，", "走时则交由石英负责 --- 而秒本身", "如今由铯原子定义。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}